  "text": "The trade you take tired is rarely your cleanest trade.\n\nAt 1 a.m. every chart can start to look like a setup.\n\nRay’s reminder: sleep is part of risk management. A clear head helps you see the checklist, respect the rules, and leave the forced trade alone.\n\nMarkets open again tomorrow. So does the same pattern.\n\nEducational content only. Not financial advice.\n\n#TheBetterTraders #TradingEducation #RiskManagement #CryptoTrading",
